# Store and check out the payload with LF endings only.
#
# EXTRACTED-FILES.sha256 pins the SHA256 of every tracked source file and
# Build-Reproduce.ps1 derives its stage fingerprints from the same bytes, so a
# line-ending conversion would silently change those hashes. The Git for
# Windows system config on this machine sets core.autocrlf=true, hence the
# explicit eol=lf.
* text=auto eol=lf
